== Overview ==
The '''Astro Toilet''' is an enemy with one of the highest health in the entire game and is one of the fastest toilets. He consists of a black toilet with a helmet and black armor plating on the bowl. He also has three constantly turning claws attachments, with electricity between each one.
[[File:Astro toilet.png|thumb|''Boss Healthbar of [[Astro Toilet]] in game'']]
He has a base HP of 68,896,584(Multiplies depending on amount of players in the match). 
== Appearance ==
He appears to be a black toilet with a black helmet and black armor plating on the bowl. He lacks a cistern, and the bowl looks different from other toilets. He also has three constantly turning claws attachments, which look like 2 pronged spears, with orange electricity crackling between each one.
== Waves ==
The Astro Toilet spawns on Wave 110 and beyond (Endless Mode).

The Astro Toilet also spawns in Ohio Mode, with a 1% chance of spawning each wave.

The Astro Toilet also spawns in Abysmal Mode during late game.

== Abilities ==
Ability 1: Laser: Combines his claws together to fire a laser beam to stun units Or Can Hold 3 Toilets sometimes ''5-7,5% for it'' 

Ability 2:Claw Attack: Attacks a unit with it's claw, stunning it and A no DMG/DPS For 5-10 secs 

== Strategy ==
Use towers with the pierce ability (e.g. [[Titan Centurion Speakerman]], [[Titan Luckbringer Drillman]])
Also try using towers that can slow (e.g. [[Chained Watchman Of Doom]], [[Gravity Gun Cameraman]], and [[Headless Camerawoman]]) to combat its speed.

== Trivia ==
*He is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Detainer_Astro_Toilet#Upgraded_Detainer_Astro_Toilet_(2.0) Upgraded Detainer Astro Toilet] from the series, which appears in episode 70 (part 1).
*He used to have 68,896,584 HP before It was buffed to 121.753.992 HP.
*His name does not specify what type of Astro Toilet he is, but we know that he is Detainer Astro Toilet. This is because he came out during a time when we only knew his race's name, so he was subbed "Astro Toilet."
*His render/boss icon used to not have its face on it. It is unknown why but is was end up fixed.
